      "description": "A species of rabbit that lives only in desert environments. No one knows why they live out there in the middle of a desert bu they always carry edible plants for them to consume. They may be docile, but they are very keen of enemies. Don't expect big rewards for butchering this sweet little bunny that attacks with sharp teeth!"
